			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 222000301,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}找到那道最容易填飽肚子的菜了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						222000302,
						222000304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一成"
				},
				{
					"id": 222000302,
					"content": "做好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						222000303
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 222000303,
					"content": "那太好了，讓我嚐嚐。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "一成"
				},
				{
					"id": 222000304,
					"content": "還沒有。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						222000305
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 222000305,
					"content": "好吧，漁人吐司的話，「萬民堂」平時就有賣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						222000307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一成"
				},
				{
					"id": 222000307,
					"content": "唔，我聽從蒙德來的商人說，「獵鹿人」餐館有一道嘟嘟蓮海鮮羹，感覺味道應該很不錯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						222000308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一成"
				},
				{
					"id": 222000308,
					"content": "還有蒙德烤魚和甜甜花釀雞，這兩道菜做起來應該很簡單吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						222000309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "一成"
				},
				{
					"id": 222000309,
					"content": "咕嚕…啊…一報菜名肚子更餓了咕嚕…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "一成"
				}
			]
		},
		{
